      949          FRAME DIALOG-1:SCROLLABLE       = FALSE.
      950   ASSIGN
      951          b-spr:HIDDEN IN FRAME DIALOG-1           = TRUE.
      952   on choose of btn_ok in frame dialog-1 do:
      953   define variable vss-include-info5 as character format "X(65)" no-undo initial "@(#)$Workfile$ $Revision$".
      954   if lookup(self :type
      955            ,'BROWSE,FILL-IN,FRAME,BUTTON,RADIO-SET,COMBO-BOX,SELECTION-LIST,CONTROL-FRAME,SLIDER,DIALOG-BOX,TOGGLE-BOX,EDITOR,WINDOW'
      956            ) = 0
      957   then do:
